.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH snip-gist-url 1  "snip 0.4.1" 
.SH NAME
snip\-gist\-url \- Print the URL of the snippet\*(Aqs gist
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnip gist url\fR [\fB\-\-copy\fR] [\fB\-\-library\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISELECTOR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the URL of the snippet\*(Aqs gist
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-copy\fR
Copy the URL to the clipboard as well as printing it
.TP
\fB\-\-library\fR \fI<LIBRARY>\fR
Library root. Falls back to SNIP_LIBRARY, ancestor discovery, then config
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Structured output mode for commands that return records
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
human
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
jsonl
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<COLOR>\fR
Color policy for terminal preview
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISELECTOR\fR>

